{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8c39b157-db0e-11ef-b58c-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8c39b143-db0e-11ef-ae4b-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":0,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"潼","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"尉遲迥","people_name_jianti_auto":"尉迟迥","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"b14c76d0-db0e-11ef-8a91-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"蜀","place_name_jianti_auto":"蜀","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b14c76d1-db0e-11ef-8aa5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"史言尉遲迥能凝蜀人之心。","note_content_jianti_auto":"史言尉迟迥能凝蜀人之心。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":123,"tongjian_id":"b14c76cf-db0e-11ef-b47e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"潼","place_name_jianti_auto":"潼","resolved_place_entity_id":2315,"start_index":146,"tongjian_id":"b14c76e2-db0e-11ef-b7ad-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/序","excerpts":[{"context_after":"，郭崇韬之于王衍，王全斌之于孟昶，此以栈道亡蜀者也。岑彭...","context_before":"...之而亡蜀者，有之矣。司马错之于蜀侯，钟会、邓艾之于后主，","source_end_index":1152,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"e6e78279-d42c-51f6-89bf-e4cb94830913","source_start_index":1145,"source_text":"尉迟迥之于萧纪"}],"path":"四川方舆纪要/序","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"20魏尉遲迥圍成都五旬，永豐侯撝屢出戰，皆敗，乃請降。諸將欲不許，迥曰：「降之則將士全，遠人悅；攻之則將士傷，遠人懼。」遂受之。八月，戊戌，撝與宜都王圓肅帥文武詣軍門降，迥以禮接之，與盟於益州城北。吏民皆復其業，唯收奴婢及儲積以賞將士，軍無私焉。魏以撝及圓肅並爲開府儀同三司，以迥爲大都督益·潼等十二州諸軍事、益州刺史。","content_fanyi":"西魏尉迟迥围攻成都五十天，永丰侯萧撝多次出城迎战，都遭到失败，于是请求投降。西魏众将领不想接受投降，尉迟迥说：“接受投降，我军将士不受损伤，归服的远方百姓也高兴；强行进攻，那么将士会有伤亡，远方百姓也会恐惧。”于是接受了萧撝的投降。八月戊戌日，即八月初八日，萧撝与宜都王萧圆肃率领文武官员到西魏军营门前投降，尉迟迥以礼相待，并在益州城北，也就是成都城北，与萧撝等人订立受降盟约。官民都恢复原来的职位和生业，只收缴奴婢和仓储积蓄用来赏赐将士，全军没有私自侵占财物的。西魏任命萧撝和萧圆肃同为开府仪同三司，任命尉迟迥为大都督益州、潼州等十二州诸军事、益州刺史。","content_jianti_auto":"20魏尉迟迥围成都五旬，永丰侯㧑屡出战，皆败，乃请降。诸将欲不许，迥曰：「降之则将士全，远人悦；攻之则将士伤，远人惧。」遂受之。八月，戊戌，㧑与宜都王圆肃帅文武诣军门降，迥以礼接之，与盟于益州城北。吏民皆复其业，唯收奴婢及储积以赏将士，军无私焉。魏以㧑及圆肃并为开府仪同三司，以迥为大都督益·潼等十二州诸军事、益州刺史。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":15535,"number":20,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百六十五 (梁紀二十一) / 世祖孝元皇帝下 / 承聖二年 / 第 26 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"b14c76cd-db0e-11ef-abb1-a0d3651f611f","year_int":553},"tongjian_id":"b14c76cd-db0e-11ef-abb1-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"潼","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"韓歸範","people_name_jianti_auto":"韩归范","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"c6f7ca40-db0e-11ef-b8db-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孫揆","people_name_jianti_auto":"孙揆","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"c6f7ca41-db0e-11ef-9569-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"李克用","people_name_jianti_auto":"李克用","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"c6f7ca42-db0e-11ef-9035-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"韓歸範與孫揆俱擒，李克用遣之歸朝。","note_content_jianti_auto":"韩归范与孙揆俱擒，李克用遣之归朝。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"c6f7ca3f-db0e-11ef-b89e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"李克用","people_name_jianti_auto":"李克用","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"c6fc4b87-db0e-11ef-b3fb-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"薛阿檀","peopl