"tongjian_id":"c6fc6631-db0e-11ef-a6ab-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河北","place_name_jianti_auto":"河北","start_index":920,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6632-db0e-11ef-8c83-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"昭義","place_name_jianti_auto":"昭义","start_index":944,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6633-db0e-11ef-80ff-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"太原","place_name_jianti_auto":"太原","start_index":948,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6634-db0e-11ef-8600-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"雲夢","place_name_jianti_auto":"云梦","start_index":987,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6635-db0e-11ef-b8f1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"嶺","place_name_jianti_auto":"岭","start_index":994,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6636-db0e-11ef-ba81-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"陰地","place_name_jianti_auto":"阴地","start_index":1011,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6637-db0e-11ef-8515-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蒙阬","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒙阬","start_index":1033,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6638-db0e-11ef-a651-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":1038,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6639-db0e-11ef-98f8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"絳","place_name_jianti_auto":"绛","place_note":"山西新绛","start_index":1040,"tongjian_id":"c6fc663a-db0e-11ef-bc85-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"忻州","place_name_jianti_auto":"忻州","start_index":1045,"tongjian_id":"c6fc663b-db0e-11ef-a773-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鳳翔軍","place_name_jianti_auto":"凤翔军","start_index":1051,"tongjian_id":"c6fc663c-db0e-11ef-bc28-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"霍邑","place_name_jianti_auto":"霍邑","start_index":1055,"tongjian_id":"c6fc663d-db0e-11ef-a1af-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"岐","place_name_jianti_auto":"岐","start_index":1066,"tongjian_id":"c6fc663e-db0e-11ef-9afb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"趙城","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵城","start_index":1074,"tongjian_id":"c6fc663f-db0e-11ef-a2a2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"平陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"平阳","start_index":1081,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6640-db0e-11ef-a8f5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":1099,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6641-db0e-11ef-87c1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"絳","place_name_jianti_auto":"绛","place_note":"山西新绛","start_index":1101,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6642-db0e-11ef-a7fc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"太原","place_name_jianti_auto":"太原","start_index":1114,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6643-db0e-11ef-8b2f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隰州","place_name_jianti_auto":"隰州","start_index":1151,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6644-db0e-11ef-916b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河中","place_name_jianti_auto":"河中","start_index":1154,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6645-db0e-11ef-a132-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"陰地關","place_name_jianti_auto":"阴地关","start_index":1162,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6646-db0e-11ef-98a8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"汾隰","place_name_jianti_auto":"汾隰","start_index":1166,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6647-db0e-11ef-aff6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"汾水","place_name_jianti_auto":"汾水","start_index":1172,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6648-db0e-11ef-8186-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉州","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋州","start_index":1195,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6649-db0e-11ef-8f4c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉州","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋州","place_note":"山西省临汾市","start_index":1209,"tongjian_id":"c6fc664a-db0e-11ef-853a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河中","place_name_jianti_auto":"河中","start_index":1245,"tongjian_id":"c6fc664b-db0e-11ef-801c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"考異曰：實錄：「十一月，王師入陰地關，至汾隰，李克用遣將薛阿檀、李承嗣拒之。李存信以兵五千圍趙城，韓建以華州兵戰，存信設伏擊破之；邠、鳳之師未戰而走，禁軍自潰，由是大敗。存信直壓晉州西門，引軍攻絳州。十二月，壬午朔，晉州刺史張行恭棄城而遁。韓建以諸軍保晉州，李存信追擊，戰敗，退保絳州。張濬以汴卒、禁軍屯晉州，存信攻之三日，濬、建拔晉、絳遁還，存信收二州。」舊紀：「克用遣李存信、薛阿檀拒王師于陰地，三戰三捷，由是河西、鄜、夏、邠、岐之軍渡河西歸。韓建以諸軍保平陽，存信追之，建軍又敗，建退保絳州。張濬在晉州，存信攻之三日，相與謀云云，遂退舍五十里。十二月，壬午朔，濬、建拔晉、絳遁去。存信收晉、絳，大掠河中四郡。」張濬傳曰：「十月，濬軍至陰地，邠、岐、華三鎭之師營平陽，李存孝擊之，一戰而敗，進攻晉州。」薛居正五代史·武皇紀曰：「十月，張濬之師入晉州，遊軍至汾隰。武皇遣薛鐵山、李承嗣將騎三千出陰地關，營於洪洞，遣李存孝將兵五千營於趙城。華州韓建以壯士三百人冒犯存孝之營，存孝追擊，直壓晉州西門，張濬之師出戰，爲存孝所敗，自是閉壁不出。存孝引軍攻絳州。」李存孝傳曰：「十月，存孝引收潞之師圍張濬于平陽云云。存孝引軍攻絳州。十一月，刺史張行恭棄城而去，張濬、韓建亦由含口而遁，存孝收晉、絳。」太祖紀年錄：「十月，張濬之師入陰地關，犯汾隰，令薛鐵山、李承嗣將騎三千出陰地，繼發李存孝將兵五千進擊，營於趙城，敗韓建，直壓晉州西門，自是閉壁不出。存孝攻絳州。十二月，晉州刺史張行恭棄城遁，建、濬由含山路逃遁，遂收晉、絳。初，濬部禁軍至晉州，邠、鳳之師望風遁歸，蓋楊復恭陰沮之也。」唐末見聞錄曰：「八月五日，相公差晉州捉到天使閭大夫入京奏事，兼貢表曰：『臣某乙言：今月二十六日，臣所部南界晉州長寧關使張承暉等投臣當道齎到宰臣張濬牓一道，內稱招討處置使兼錄到詔白，云陛下削臣屬籍，奪臣本官，仍卻會兵討問』」云云。唐補紀曰：「朱全忠自攻破徐州，頻貢章表，『克用與朱玫同立襄王以爲大逆，其朱玫以下並已誅鋤，克用時最爲魁首，據其罪狀，請舉天兵。臣率師關東。掎角相應。』朝廷遂以宰臣張濬爲都統，授崔胤爲河中節度應援使。大軍行到同州，克用領蕃、漢馬步稱三十萬入河北界。其張濬使人探朱全忠兵馬，並不來相應，乃於昭義西與太原交戰，不利而回。朝廷知爲全忠所賣，便差使至克用所，與賞給令回，貶都統張濬於雲夢，除崔胤於嶺外」薛史·李承嗣傳：「初，大軍入陰地，薛志勤與承嗣率騎三千抗之，敗韓建之軍於蒙阬，進收晉、絳，以功授忻州刺史。時鳳翔軍營霍邑，承嗣帥一軍收之，岐人夜遁，追擊至趙城，合大軍攻平陽，旬有三日而拔。」按李存信傳無攻晉、絳事。蓋舊紀，十月存孝已背太原，故此戰皆云存信，實錄因之而誤。據五代紀、傳、太祖紀年錄，當是存孝。又隰州隸河中節度，所云入陰地關犯汾隰者，蓋謂汾水之旁，下濕曰隰耳。又紀年錄、實錄以張行恭爲晉州刺史，亦誤也。今從薛史。晉州刺史若已走，則濬、建安能保城！實錄誤也。今從李存孝傳。唐補紀云崔胤爲河中節度，尤爲疏繆。自餘諸書參取之。","note_content_jianti_auto":"考异曰：实录：「十一月，王师入阴地关，至汾隰，李克用遣将薛阿檀、李承嗣拒之。李存信以兵五千围赵城，韩建以华州兵战，存信设伏击破之；邠、凤之师未战而走，禁军自溃，由是大败。存信直压晋州西门，引军攻绛州。十二月，壬午朔，晋州刺史张行恭弃城而遁。韩建以诸军保晋州，李存信追击，战败，退保绛州。张濬以汴卒、禁军屯晋州，存信攻之三日，濬、建拔晋、绛遁还，存信收二州。」旧纪：「克用遣李存信、薛阿檀拒王师于阴地，三战三捷，由是河西、鄜、夏、邠、岐之军渡河西归。韩建以诸军保平阳，存信追之，建军又败，建退保绛州。张濬在晋州，存信攻之三日，相与谋云云，遂退舍五十里。十二月，壬午朔，濬、建拔晋、绛遁去。存信收晋、绛，大掠河中四郡。」张濬传曰：「十月，濬军至阴地，邠、岐、华三镇之师营平阳，李存孝击之，一战而败，进攻晋州。」薛居正五代史·武皇纪曰：「十月，张濬之师入晋州，游军至汾隰。武皇遣薛铁山、李承嗣将骑三千出阴地关，营于洪洞，遣李存孝将兵五千营于赵城。华州韩建以壮士三百人冒犯存孝之营，存孝追击，直压晋州西门，张濬之师出战，为存孝所败，自是闭壁不出。存孝引军攻绛州。」李存孝传曰：「十月，存孝引收潞之师围张濬于平阳云云。存孝引军攻绛州。十一月，刺史张行恭弃城而去，张濬、韩建亦由含口而遁，存孝收晋、绛。」太祖纪年录：「十月，张濬之师入阴地关，犯汾隰，令薛铁山、李承嗣将骑三千出阴地，继发李存孝将兵五千进击，营于赵城，败韩建，直压晋州西门，自是闭壁不出。存孝攻绛州。十二月，晋州刺史张行恭弃城遁，建、濬由含山路逃遁，遂收晋、绛。初，濬部禁军至晋州，邠、凤之师望风遁归，盖杨复恭阴沮之也。」唐末见闻录曰：「八月五日，相公差晋州捉到天使闾大夫入京奏事，兼贡表曰：『臣某乙言：今月二十六日，臣所部南界晋州长宁关使张承晖等投臣当道赍到宰臣张濬牓一道，内称招讨处置使兼录到诏白，云陛下削臣属籍，夺臣本官，仍却会兵讨问』」云云。唐补纪曰：「朱全忠自攻破徐州，频贡章表，『克用与朱玫同立襄王以为大逆，其朱玫以下并已诛锄，克用时最为魁首，据其罪状，请举天兵。臣率师关东。掎角相应。』朝廷遂以宰臣张濬为都统，授崔胤为河中节度应援使。大军行到同州，克用领蕃、汉马步称三十万入河北界。其张濬使人探朱全忠兵马，并不来相应，乃于昭义西与太原交战，不利而回。朝廷知为全忠所卖，便差使至克用所，与赏给令回，贬都统张濬于云梦，除崔胤于岭外」薛史·李承嗣传：「初，大军入阴地，薛志勤与承嗣率骑三千抗之，败韩建之军于蒙阬，进收晋、绛，以功授忻州刺史。时凤翔军营霍邑，承嗣帅一军收之，岐人夜遁，追击至赵城，合大军攻平阳，旬有三日而拔。」按李存信传无攻晋、绛事。盖旧纪，十月存孝已背太原，故此战皆云存信，实录因之而误。据五代纪、传、太祖纪年录，当是存孝。又隰州隶河中节度，所云入阴地关犯汾隰者，盖谓汾水之旁，下湿曰隰耳。又纪年录、实录以张行恭为晋州刺史，亦误也。今从薛史。晋州刺史若已走，则濬、建安能保城！实录误也。今从李存孝传。唐补纪云崔胤为河中节度，尤为疏缪。自余诸书参取之。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"c6f7ca43-db0e-11ef-afe9-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"explicit_reference","source_end_index":37,"source_start_index":21,"source_text":"破龐勛見二百五十一卷懿宗咸通十年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"c53afac1-db0e-11ef-9bf5-a0d3651f611f"},{"relation_type":"explicit_reference","source_end_index":54,"source_start_index":38,"source_text":"翦黃巢見二百五十五卷僖宗中和三年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"c634a173-db0e-11ef-8493-a0d3651f611f"},{"relation_type":"explicit_reference","source_end_index":72,"source_start_index":58,"source_text":"黜襄王見二百五十六卷光啓二年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"c681fbdc-db0e-11ef-bd56-a0d3651f611f"},{"relation_type":"explicit_reference","source_end_index":81,"source_start_index":73,"source_text":"存易定見光啓元年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"c668abff-db0e-11ef-a24d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"執宜","people_name_jianti_auto":"执宜","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6663-db0e-11ef-aa4d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"國昌","people_name_jianti_auto":"国昌","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6664-db0e-11ef-9b47-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"克用","people_name_jianti_auto":"克用","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6665-db0e-11ef-b1de-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"武","people_name_jianti_auto":"武","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6666-db0e-11ef-ad9c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"宣","people_name_jianti_auto":"宣","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6667-db0e-11ef-9f1c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"懿","people_name_jianti_auto":"懿","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6668-db0e-11ef-aa37-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"僖","people_name_jianti_auto":"僖","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6669-db0e-11ef-9346-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"龐勛","people_name_jianti_auto":"庞勋","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"c6fc666a-db0e-11ef-a2c7-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"懿宗","people_name_jianti_auto":"懿宗","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"c6fc666b-db0e-11ef-99bb-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"黃巢","people_name_jianti_auto":"黄巢","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"c6fc666c-db0e-11ef-91da-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"僖宗","people_name_jianti_auto":"僖宗","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"c6fc666d-db0e-11ef-85d0-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"襄王","people_name_jianti_auto":"襄王","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"c6fc666e-db0e-11ef-8442-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"易定","place_name_jianti_auto":"易定","place_note":"总部设定州【河北省定州市】","start_index":74,"tongjian_id":"c6fc666f-db0e-11ef-9f7a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"執宜、國昌、克用三代歷武、宣、懿、僖四朝。破龐勛見二百五十一卷懿宗咸通十年。翦黃巢見二百五十五卷僖宗中和三年、四年，黜襄王見二百五十六卷光啓二年。存易定見光啓元年。","note_content_jianti_auto":"执宜、国昌、克用三代历武、宣、懿、僖四朝。破庞勋见二百五十一卷懿宗咸通十年。翦黄巢见二百五十五卷僖宗中和三年、四年，黜襄王见二百五十六卷光启二年。存易定见光启元年。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6662-db0e-11ef-b0f3-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"拓跋思恭","people_name_jianti_auto":"拓跋思恭","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6672-db0e-11ef-908d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"思孝","people_name_jianti_auto":"思孝","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6673-db0e-11ef-b897-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"鄜延","place_name_jianti_auto":"鄜延","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6674-db0e-11ef-b511-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"拓跋思恭取鄜延，以授其弟思孝。","note_content_jianti_auto":"拓跋思恭取鄜延，以授其弟思孝。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":91,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6671-db0e-11ef-bd10-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"朱全忠","people_name_jianti_auto":"朱全忠","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6676-db0e-11ef-8d8c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"時溥","people_name_jianti_auto":"时溥","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6677-db0e-11ef-9882-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"朱瑄","people_name_jianti_auto":"朱瑄","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6678-db0e-11ef-ba21-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"徐","place_name_jianti_auto":"徐","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6679-db0e-11ef-8735-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鄆","place_name_jianti_auto":"郓","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"c6fc667a-db0e-11ef-bda8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"謂朱全忠攻時溥於徐，攻朱瑄於鄆，事並見上。","note_content_jianti_auto":"谓朱全忠攻时溥于徐，攻朱瑄于郓，事并见上。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":100,"tongjian_id":"c6fc6675-db0e-11ef-90bc-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"阽，余廉翻，又丁念翻。臨危曰阽危。譽，音余，稱譽。","note_content_jianti_auto":"阽，余廉翻，又丁念翻。临危曰阽危。誉，音余，称誉。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":136,"tongjian_id":"c6fc667b-db0e-11ef-82d7-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"扆，隱豈翻。記：天子負扆南面而立。扆，畫斧屛風也，設之戶牖間。坐，徂臥翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"扆，隐岂翻。记：天子负扆南面而立。扆，画斧屛风也，设之户牖间。坐，徂卧翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":274,"tongjian_id":"c6fc667c-db0e-11ef-876f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"司敗，卽司寇之官。","note_content_jianti_auto":"司败，即司寇之官。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":297,"tongjian_id":"c6fc667e-db0e-11ef-b7ec-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Childre